# Evidence and who made this record
#
# Citations, model runs, scholar decisions. 'draft' stays draft until a person signs it off.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m20_provenance> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Evidence and who made this record" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: prov:Activity

iy:ModelRun a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Activity .
iy:Review a owl:Class .

iy:evidence a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:check a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:tier a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:reviewStatus a owl:ObjectProperty .
